1
00:00:00,076 --> 00:00:03,041
Like, ten-to-seventeen-years hard.

2
00:00:03,351 --> 00:00:08,377
Start the search the year we were born,
and it might only be ready now.

3
00:00:08,698 --> 00:00:12,522
It can cost almost 2.8 billion
US dollars.

4
00:00:12,822 --> 00:00:18,749
And of drugs tested in people, only
about one in ten reaches the market.

5
00:00:19,351 --> 00:00:22,592
To see why, let's follow
one drug's journey.

6
00:00:23,033 --> 00:00:25,814
Every medicine walks the same road.

7
00:00:26,134 --> 00:00:27,275
Find a target.

8
00:00:28,055 --> 00:00:32,517
Find a hit, a first molecule
that works on it.
